                "text": "<p>These flat woven towels are thin like a sheet but very absorbent like a towel! That's why they are called towels as well as bath sheets. Wrap them around yourself and see the difference that a lightweight towel can make!</p><p>For the bath, beach and travel. Often used as a towel, light blanket, shawl or sarong. Machine wash and dry without worry of shrinking. Safe for sensitive skin and sensory needs. </p><p>✔ Dries faster than terry towels<br/>✔ Packs small, perfect for travel<br/>✔ Gets softer with every wash<br/>✔ Durable woven cotton lasts years<br/>✔ No more crunchy towels</p><p>Your everyday luxury. Enjoy pure Turkish cotton with Canadian art woven into every fibre. These sustainable, luxury towels are ethically made in Türkiye and support charity. </p><h4>The Benefits of Good Turkish Towels</h4><ul><li>100% Turkish Cotton</li><li>3' X 6' | 90x170cm</li><li>Lightweight at 0.83lb | 370 grams</li><li>Pre-washed & won't shrink</li><li>Machine wash and dry</li><li>Long lasting</li><li>Sensitive skin approved</li><li>Modesty coverage</li><li>Soft and smooth</li></ul>",
